  "title": "Quick and Easy Hamburger Stroganoff",
  "description": "This hamburger stroganoff recipe uses canned cream of mushroom soup and cream of chicken soup for an easy beef stroganoff to serve over noodles.",
  "authors": [
    "Denny"
  ],
